<title>UK: Sweden's SBAB sets $500 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Sweden's SBAB sets $500 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH NATIONAL HOUSING FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    19.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE   S09.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   17.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA	  REOFFER    PAR	 S=SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7.5 BP    SELL CONC  10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	IF SWEDEN CEASES TO HOLD AT LEAST 51 PERCENT OF THE</p>
<p>VOTING RIGHTS THE BOND-HOLDERS WILL HAVE (IN THE ABSENCE OF ANY PRIOR GUARANTEE FROM SWEDEN) THE RIGHT TO PUT THE BONDS AT PAR. SWEDEN CURRENTLY HOLDS 100 PERCENT. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
